L258 COMPLETE: 2/11 checks PASS.
READING: the puzzle is not finished.  Rung 9 (Omega_Lambda 'from a_0') returns the Planck value that built a_0;
rung 4's three 'derivations' each insert the r^-2 profile they claim to derive, and the lane cited for the
promotion fails 8 of its own 11 checks; the completion inherits the Cassini kill through its own static law and
its referee defence splices two incompatible theories; the lensing, cluster and Milky-Way mass is cold dark
matter with a fitted or fed-back abundance.  What STANDS since PAPER29: the honest negatives (G059 partition,
G044 EFE split), the asymmetric-drift channel for the sag (G057, open on sigma_z), the Lean algebra, and this
track's L248/L257 on what lensing does and does not test.  PAPER29's labels are unchanged by the 09-14/15 batch.
